19348      /* STAT-SURVEYFREQ-008: SURVEYFREQ — TABLES / Specifying the Sample Design / Domain Analysis
19349       * Source: S154 / Chapter 118 / `TABLES Statement` (PDF pp. 9602–9626); S154 / Chapter 118 / `Specifying the Sample Design` (PDF pp. 9627–9629);
19349    ! S154 / Chapter 118 / `Domain Analysis` (PDF pp. 9629–9630).
19350       * Discriminates: Verified default procedure context; explicit statements: TABLES
19351       */
19352      options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
19352    ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
19353      %let syscc=0;
19354      title; footnote;
19355      ods _all_ close;
19356      ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
19357      ods graphics off;
19358      proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
NOTE: File WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SURVEY (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
19358    !                                         quit;


19359      ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
19360      
19361      data survey;
19362      do state=1 to 2;
19363      do school=1 to 4;
19364      do id=1 to 6;
19365      response=1+mod(id+school,3);
19366      schooltype=1+mod(school,2);
19367      samplingweight=2+state+school/10;
19368      output;
19369      end;
19370      end;
19371      end;
19372      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SURVEY has 48 observations and 6 variables.

19373      proc surveyfreq data=survey;
19374      strata state;
19375      cluster school;
19376      weight samplingweight;
19377      tables schooltype*response / row chisq;
19378      run;

NOTE: The Rao-Scott chi-square test cannot be computed for the table of schooltype by response because the design correction is not positive.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE SURVEYFREQ printed page 1384.

